; cross-train-oracle.form — teaching, selected examples, and observed learning.
;
; The native learning lanes live in the pinned Form body. This teaching describes
; the parent MCP boundary; a retained example is not proof of training or efficacy.

(cross-train-oracle

  (teacher
    "The MCP carrier does not select or launch a separate teacher model."
    "coherence_transmute returns faithful editing instructions to the current chat;"
    "the chat's actual model supplies the rewrite, with its provenance kept honest."
    "Native training and teacher selection are separate Form-owned operations;"
    "their current source and observed results establish what runs.")

  (configuration
    "The MCP carrier reads its mcp settings from api/config/api.json, overlaid by"
    "~/.coherence-network/config.json. Paths and transport come from these files."
    "There is no environment-variable oracle override or implicit model launch.")

  (corpus
    "Automatic Stop-hook and detached-worker capture are retired. Ordinary chat,"
    "rewriting, installation and public sharing do not authorize a learning copy."
    "coherence_capture accepts an exact user-selected request, original and reviewed"
    "rewrite only with selected-excerpt-local-learning-v1 consent for that sample."
    "The receipt identifies the local catalog and content fingerprints without"
    "echoing the excerpt. This copy survives chat deletion until removed from its"
    "own catalog; removal does not untrain a model or erase other copies."
    "A write-stage failure may leave data: inspect an indeterminate receipt before"
    "retrying or assuming the sample is absent.")

  (repository-excerpts
    "scripts/training_corpus.py is a manual import of selected repository edges."
    "Its --capture-consent applies only to that invocation. The post-merge hook"
    "does not enroll repository changes for learning automatically.")

  (learning-evidence
    "A reviewed teacher example is candidate evidence, not ground truth by origin."
    "Preserve provenance, disagreements and the limits of the observation."
    "The native predictor and scoring organs may use authorized examples; prove"
    "their actual effect on a separate evaluation before claiming improvement."
    "Retention establishes a saved sample. Training requires its own run receipt."
    "A routing result over supplied scores is not a measurement of readiness.")

  (direction
    "Grow native capability from consented, reviewed examples and measured outcomes."
    "Keep the person's choice to receive help separate from the choice to teach."))
